{"seq":4,"slug":"common-grammar-mistakes","title":"常见语法错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/common-grammar-mistakes","wordCount":910,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"常见语法错误\">常见语法错误</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>语法错误是英语学习者最常遇到的障碍。许多错误源于母语（中文）思维的干扰，另一些则是英语自身不规则规则的陷阱。本文整理了中国英语学习者最高频的语法错误，帮助你在写作和口语中避免这些问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语法错误可归纳为几个稳定的类别，理解每类的<strong>成因</strong>比逐条记忆更能避免复发：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>母语迁移型</strong>：中文思维直接套用，如&quot;因为…所以…&quot;变成 <code>Because...so...</code>、&quot;很&quot;变成 <code>very like</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>规则例外型</strong>：英语自身的不规则规则，如不规则动词、不可数名词、a/an 按发音而非字母选择。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性型</strong>：主谓一致、时态呼应、平行结构等需要在句内多处保持一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下图展示高频错误的分类脉络：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[&quot;常见语法错误&quot;] --&gt; A1[&quot;主谓一致&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A2[&quot;时态使用&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A3[&quot;冠词&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A4[&quot;介词搭配&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A5[&quot;代词与指代&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A6[&quot;词性混淆&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A7[&quot;句子结构&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; A8[&quot;拼写与标点&quot;]&#10;    A1 --&gt; B1[&quot;三单漏 -s / 不可数名词&quot;]&#10;    A3 --&gt; B2[&quot;漏冠词 / 多冠词 / a-an&quot;]&#10;    A7 --&gt; B3[&quot;悬垂修饰 / 平行结构 / 逗号拼接&quot;]\">graph TD\n    E[\"常见语法错误\"] --&gt; A1[\"主谓一致\"]\n    E --&gt; A2[\"时态使用\"]\n    E --&gt; A3[\"冠词\"]\n    E --&gt; A4[\"介词搭配\"]\n    E --&gt; A5[\"代词与指代\"]\n    E --&gt; A6[\"词性混淆\"]\n    E --&gt; A7[\"句子结构\"]\n    E --&gt; A8[\"拼写与标点\"]\n    A1 --&gt; B1[\"三单漏 -s / 不可数名词\"]\n    A3 --&gt; B2[\"漏冠词 / 多冠词 / a-an\"]\n    A7 --&gt; B3[\"悬垂修饰 / 平行结构 / 逗号拼接\"]</pre><h2 id=\"主谓一致错误\">主谓一致错误</h2><h3 id=\"第三人称单数忘加-s\">第三人称单数忘加 -s</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ She go to school every day.&#10;✅ She goes to school every day.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She go to school every day.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She goes to school every day.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"集合名词的单复数\">集合名词的单复数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名词</th>\n<th>英式英语</th>\n<th>美式英语</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>team</td>\n<td>The team are ready.</td>\n<td>The team is ready.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>family</td>\n<td>My family are all here.</td>\n<td>My family is all here.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"不可数名词误用复数\">不可数名词误用复数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I need some informations.&#10;✅ I need some information.&#10;&#10;❌ He gave me many advices.&#10;✅ He gave me much advice.  /  He gave me several pieces of advice.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I need some informations.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I need some information.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ He gave me many advices.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ He gave me much advice.  /  He gave me several pieces of advice.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常见不可数名词</strong>：information, advice, furniture, equipment, luggage, homework, research</p>\n<h2 id=\"时态使用错误\">时态使用错误</h2><h3 id=\"现在完成时-vs-一般过去时\">现在完成时 vs. 一般过去时</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I have visited Paris last year.&#10;✅ I visited Paris last year.&#10;&#10;❌ I already finished my homework.&#10;✅ I have already finished my homework.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I have visited Paris last year.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I visited Paris last year.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I already finished my homework.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I have already finished my homework.</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>规则</strong>：有具体过去时间标志（yesterday, last week, in 2020）→ 用一般过去时。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间-条件从句中误用将来时\">时间/条件从句中误用将来时</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I will call you when I will arrive.&#10;✅ I will call you when I arrive.&#10;&#10;❌ If it will rain, we will stay home.&#10;✅ If it rains, we will stay home.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I will call you when I will arrive.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I will call you when I arrive.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ If it will rain, we will stay home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ If it rains, we will stay home.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"冠词使用错误\">冠词使用错误</h2><h3 id=\"遗漏冠词\">遗漏冠词</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I am student.&#10;✅ I am a student.&#10;&#10;❌ Sun rises in east.&#10;✅ The sun rises in the east.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I am student.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I am a student.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Sun rises in east.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The sun rises in the east.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"冠词多余\">冠词多余</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I like the music.（泛指音乐）&#10;✅ I like music.&#10;&#10;❌ The life is beautiful.（泛指生活）&#10;✅ Life is beautiful.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I like the music.（泛指音乐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I like music.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The life is beautiful.（泛指生活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Life is beautiful.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"a-vs-an\">a vs. an</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ a hour, a honest person&#10;✅ an hour, an honest person（按发音而非字母）&#10;&#10;❌ an university, an uniform&#10;✅ a university, a uniform（/juː/ 是辅音音素）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ a hour, a honest person</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ an hour, an honest person（按发音而非字母）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ an university, an uniform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ a university, a uniform（/juː/ 是辅音音素）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"介词使用错误\">介词使用错误</h2><h3 id=\"常见介词搭配\">常见介词搭配</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>正确用法</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>depend on</td>\n<td>❌ depend of</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>consist of</td>\n<td>❌ consist with</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>different from</td>\n<td>❌ different with</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>married to</td>\n<td>❌ married with</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>arrive at/in</td>\n<td>❌ arrive to</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>listen to</td>\n<td>❌ listen (无介词)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"中式英语的介词干扰\">中式英语的介词干扰</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ I very like it.（受中文&quot;我很喜欢&quot;影响）&#10;✅ I like it very much.&#10;&#10;❌ Although...but...（虽然…但是…）&#10;✅ Although he is tired, he keeps working.（不能同时用 although 和 but）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I very like it.（受中文\"我很喜欢\"影响）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I like it very much.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Although...but...（虽然…但是…）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Although he is tired, he keeps working.（不能同时用 although 和 but）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"代词与指代错误\">代词与指代错误</h2><h3 id=\"代词指代不明\">代词指代不明</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Tom told Jerry that he was wrong.（he 指谁？）&#10;✅ Tom told Jerry, &quot;You are wrong.&quot;  或  Tom told Jerry that Jerry was wrong.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Tom told Jerry that he was wrong.（he 指谁？）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Tom told Jerry, \"You are wrong.\"  或  Tom told Jerry that Jerry was wrong.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"it-vs-there-的混用\">it vs. there 的混用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ It has a book on the table.&#10;✅ There is a book on the table.&#10;&#10;❌ There is raining.&#10;✅ It is raining.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ It has a book on the table.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ There is a book on the table.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ There is raining.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ It is raining.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"词性混淆\">词性混淆</h2><h3 id=\"形容词-vs-副词\">形容词 vs. 副词</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ She sings beautiful.&#10;✅ She sings beautifully.&#10;&#10;❌ I feel badly about it.&#10;✅ I feel bad about it.（feel 是系动词，后接形容词）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She sings beautiful.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She sings beautifully.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ I feel badly about it.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ I feel bad about it.（feel 是系动词，后接形容词）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见词性混淆对\">常见词性混淆对</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名词</th>\n<th>动词</th>\n<th>形容词</th>\n<th>副词</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>success</td>\n<td>succeed</td>\n<td>successful</td>\n<td>successfully</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>difference</td>\n<td>differ</td>\n<td>different</td>\n<td>differently</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>economy</td>\n<td>economize</td>\n<td>economic/economical</td>\n<td>economically</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"句子结构错误\">句子结构错误</h2><h3 id=\"悬垂修饰语-dangling-modifier\">悬垂修饰语（Dangling Modifier）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ Walking down the street, the trees were beautiful.&#10;   （树在走路？）&#10;✅ Walking down the street, I noticed the beautiful trees.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ Walking down the street, the trees were beautiful.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   （树在走路？）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Walking down the street, I noticed the beautiful trees.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"平行结构-parallelism\">平行结构（Parallelism）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ She likes reading, to swim, and plays tennis.&#10;✅ She likes reading, swimming, and playing tennis.&#10;&#10;❌ The course is both interesting and a challenge.&#10;✅ The course is both interesting and challenging.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ She likes reading, to swim, and plays tennis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ She likes reading, swimming, and playing tennis.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>❌ The course is both interesting and a challenge.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ The course is both interesting and challenging.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"逗号拼接-comma-splice\">逗号拼接（Comma Splice）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"❌ It was raining, we stayed home.&#10;✅ It was raining, so we stayed home.&#10;✅ It was raining; we stayed home.&#10;✅ Because it was raining, we stayed home.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>❌ It was raining, we stayed home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ It was raining, so we stayed home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ It was raining; we stayed home.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>✅ Because it was raining, we stayed home.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"拼写与标点陷阱\">拼写与标点陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"易混淆词\">易混淆词</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>词 A</th>\n<th>词 B</th>\n<th>区别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>its</td>\n<td>it&#39;s</td>\n<td>its（它的） vs. it&#39;s（it is / it has）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>their</td>\n<td>there / they&#39;re</td>\n<td>他们的 / 那里 / they are</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>affect</td>\n<td>effect</td>\n<td>动词（影响） vs. 名词（效果）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>than</td>\n<td>then</td>\n<td>比较 vs. 然后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lose</td>\n<td>loose</td>\n<td>丢失 vs. 松的</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自查清单\">自查清单</h2><p>写完英语文章后，按以下清单逐项检查：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个句子是否有主语和谓语？</li>\n<li>主谓是否一致（单复数）？</li>\n<li>动词时态是否正确且前后一致？</li>\n<li>冠词是否该加的加了、不该加的去掉了？</li>\n<li>介词搭配是否正确？</li>\n<li>代词指代是否清晰？</li>\n<li>修饰语位置是否合理？</li>\n<li>平行结构是否对称？</li>\n<li>是否有逗号拼接？</li>\n<li>易混淆词是否用对了？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><ul>\n<li>把自己的写作中反复出现的错误记录在&quot;错误本&quot;上</li>\n<li>请母语者或语法检查工具（如 Grammarly）辅助校对</li>\n<li>每周集中练习一类语法点，逐个攻克</li>\n<li>朗读自己的文章，耳朵往往比眼睛更容易发现错误</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>中国学习者最高频的语法错误集中在主谓一致、时态、冠词、介词、代词、词性和句子结构八类。</li>\n<li>大量错误源于母语迁移（如双重连词、very like），识别成因比死记条目更有效。</li>\n<li>不可数名词（information, advice, furniture 等）不加复数；a/an 按读音而非字母选择。</li>\n<li>写完文章可对照自查清单逐项检查，并建立个人&quot;错误本&quot;记录反复出现的错误。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"常见语法错误","id":"常见语法错误"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主谓一致错误","id":"主谓一致错误"},{"level":3,"text":"第三人称单数忘加 -s","id":"第三人称单数忘加-s"},{"level":3,"text":"集合名词的单复数","id":"集合名词的单复数"},{"level":3,"text":"不可数名词误用复数","id":"不可数名词误用复数"},{"level":2,"text":"时态使用错误","id":"时态使用错误"},{"level":3,"text":"现在完成时 vs. 一般过去时","id":"现在完成时-vs-一般过去时"},{"level":3,"text":"时间/条件从句中误用将来时","id":"时间-条件从句中误用将来时"},{"level":2,"text":"冠词使用错误","id":"冠词使用错误"},{"level":3,"text":"遗漏冠词","id":"遗漏冠词"},{"level":3,"text":"冠词多余","id":"冠词多余"},{"level":3,"text":"a vs. an","id":"a-vs-an"},{"level":2,"text":"介词使用错误","id":"介词使用错误"},{"level":3,"text":"常见介词搭配","id":"常见介词搭配"},{"level":3,"text":"中式英语的介词干扰","id":"中式英语的介词干扰"},{"level":2,"text":"代词与指代错误","id":"代词与指代错误"},{"level":3,"text":"代词指代不明","id":"代词指代不明"},{"level":3,"text":"it vs. there 的混用","id":"it-vs-there-的混用"},{"level":2,"text":"词性混淆","id":"词性混淆"},{"level":3,"text":"形容词 vs. 副词","id":"形容词-vs-副词"},{"level":3,"text":"常见词性混淆对","id":"常见词性混淆对"},{"level":2,"text":"句子结构错误","id":"句子结构错误"},{"level":3,"text":"悬垂修饰语（Dangling Modifier）","id":"悬垂修饰语-dangling-modifier"},{"level":3,"text":"平行结构（Parallelism）","id":"平行结构-parallelism"},{"level":3,"text":"逗号拼接（Comma Splice）","id":"逗号拼接-comma-splice"},{"level":2,"text":"拼写与标点陷阱","id":"拼写与标点陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"易混淆词","id":"易混淆词"},{"level":2,"text":"自查清单","id":"自查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"从句与复合句","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/grammar-foundations/clauses-and-complex-sentences"},"next":{"title":"词根词缀记忆法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/english-learning/vocabulary-strategies/root-affix-method"}}